# Delivery options

| option | Java body source | XML body source | delivery |
|---|---|---|---|
| scoped | starter/customization/java-rules.md.template | starter/customization/xml-rules.md.template | applyTo別の供給設計 |
| manual equivalent | starter/customization/java-rules.md.template | starter/customization/xml-rules.md.template | 同じbody全文を同じ順序で手動供給 |

## Task order

- java-reading:
- xml-reading:
- mixed-reading:

mixed-readingではJava/XML bodyを要約せず、scoped原稿で凍結した順序を保ちます。供給設計は実採用やsource accessを保証しません。
